    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a distinct, typically rectangular section or compartment of a wainscot, door, shutter, etc., usually of wood or glass and generally thinner than the surround (OED s.v. panel n.1 II.i.5.a)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
